---
import Skelet from "../layouts/Skelet.astro";
import CardCategory from "../components/Card_Category.astro";
import "../style/styles.css";
import ProgramCard from "../components/Program_Card.astro";
---

<Skelet>
  <section class="news_singleview_grid">
    <a href="news.html" class="back_arrow_section">
      <img src="/public/imgs/Program/numbers/arrow.svg" alt="arrow" />
    </a>

    <section class="left_img_column">
      <img
        id="changingImageDesktop"
        src="/public/imgs/Program/day-1/Designing-Brands-in-a-Noisy-World/img1.webp"
        alt="Article Image"
      />
    </section>

    <section class="right_txt_column">
      <div class="news_date_and_author_flex">
        <p>Date: 22.05.25</p>
        <p>Author: Lena Hartmann</p>
      </div>
      <div class="news_topics_flex">
        <CardCategory className="newsNoMargin" text="Recommendation" />
        <CardCategory className="newsNoMargin" text="Branding" />
      </div>
      <div class="news_txt">
        <h2>
          Sara Coleman Brings Bold Branding Energy to the Stage at This Year’s Design Festival
        </h2>
        <p>
          One of the most anticipated talks at this year’s Design Festival is set to energize the
          crowd with insight, color, and creative fire. On September 4, 2025, acclaimed creative
          director Sara Coleman will take the stage for a special session titled "Designing Brands
          in a Noisy World", offering a deep dive into what it takes to cut through the clutter of
          today’s digital landscape.
          <br /><br />
          <img
            id="changingImageMobile"
            src="/public/imgs/Program/day-1/Designing-Brands-in-a-Noisy-World/img1.webp"
            alt="Article Image"
          />
          <br /><br />

          Coleman, the driving force behind Berlin-based agency Coleman & Co. Branding, brings over
          15 years of experience crafting brand identities that demand attention. Her client list
          reads like a who’s who of global powerhouses—Adidas, Volkswagen, Coca-Cola—but it’s her
          work in the youth-driven sports apparel scene that’s been making serious waves lately.
          <br /><br />
          In her talk, Coleman will explore how strong visual storytelling and strategic brand narratives
          can rise above the noise. She’ll share behind-the-scenes insights from recent campaigns developed
          for ski and skate brands, where she helped shape a vibrant aesthetic geared toward younger
          audiences. Known for her use of striking photography, cheeky quotes, and community-driven content
          (think snowboard stunts, après-ski moments, and branded DJ nights), Coleman has successfully
          blended cultural relevance with visual impact—making brands not just seen, but felt.
          <br /><br />
          With a reputation for building brands that are bold, fun, and socially magnetic, Coleman's
          session promises to be as inspiring as it is practical. Whether you're a startup founder, a
          design student, or a veteran creative looking to refresh your approach, this is one talk you
          won’t want to miss.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="news_event_details">
        <h3>( Event Details )</h3>
        <img
          class="porgramCard_placehoder"
          src="/public/imgs/Program/day-3/ Beyond Engagement Marketing with Purpose/img3.webp"
          alt=""
        />
        <p>
          Stay tuned for more updates and behind-the-scenes highlights from this year's Design
          Festival.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </section>
</Skelet>

<style>
  /* MOBILE */

  img {
    width: 20rem;
  }

  .news_singleview_grid {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    margin-top: 120px;
  }
  .back_arrow_section {
    padding: 20px;
    border-width: 1px;
    border-bottom-style: solid;
    img {
      width: 25px;
      transform: rotate(135deg);
    }
  }
  .news_date_and_author_flex,
  .news_topics_flex {
    display: flex;
  }
  .news_date_and_author_flex {
    border-bottom-style: solid;
    border-width: 1px;

    p {
      padding: 10px 20px;
    }
    & > p:first-child {
      border-right-style: solid;
      border-width: 1px;
    }
  }

  .news_topics_flex {
    padding: 20px;
    padding-bottom: 0;
    gap: 15px;
  }

  #changingImageDesktop {
    display: none;
  }

  #changingImageMobile {
    height: auto;
    width: 11rem;
    margin: 2rem 20px;
    border-radius: 30px;
    position: relative;
    left: 40%;
  }

  .news_txt {
    padding: 1.5rem 20px;

    h2 {
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }
  }
  .news_event_details {
    margin: 20px;
    margin-top: 0;

    img {
      margin: 1rem 0;
    }
  }

  /* DESKTOP */
  @media (min-width: 800px) {
    #changingImageMobile {
      display: none;
    }
    #changingImageDesktop {
      display: block;
    }
    .back_arrow_section {
      grid-column: 1/-1;
      padding: 20px 40px;

      img {
        width: 35px;
        transform: rotate(135deg);
      }
    }
    .news_singleview_grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 2fr;
      grid-template-rows: auto 1fr;
    }

    /* ----------------------------LEFT COLUMN---------------------------- */
    .left_img_column {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      border-width: 1px;
      border-right-style: solid;
      img {
        height: 25rem;
        margin: 2rem 0;
        border-radius: 30px;
        position: sticky;
        top: 10%;
      }
    }

    /* ----------------------------RIGHT COLUMN---------------------------- */
    .news_date_and_author_flex {
      p {
        padding: 10px 40px;
      }
    }
    .porgramCard_placehoder {
      width: 15rem;
      height: auto;
      border-radius: 30px;
    }

    .news_topics_flex {
      padding: 20px 40px 0px 40px;
    }

    .news_txt {
      padding: 2.5rem 40px 2.5rem 40px;

      h2 {
        margin-bottom: 2rem;
      }
    }

    .news_event_details {
      margin: 0 40px 20px 40px;

      img {
        margin: 1.5rem 0;
      }
    }
  }
</style>

<script>
  window.addEventListener("scroll", () => {
    const imgDesktop = document.getElementById("changingImageDesktop");
    const imgMobile = document.getElementById("changingImageMobile");
    const scrollY = window.scrollY;

    if (scrollY > 500) {
      imgDesktop.src = "/public/imgs/Program/day-1/Designing-Brands-in-a-Noisy-World/img1.webp";
      imgMobile.src = "/public/imgs/Program/day-1/Designing-Brands-in-a-Noisy-World/img1.webp";
    } else if (scrollY > 400) {
      imgDesktop.src = "/public/imgs/Program/day-1/Designing-Brands-in-a-Noisy-World/img2.webp";
      imgMobile.src = "/public/imgs/Program/day-1/Designing-Brands-in-a-Noisy-World/img2.webp";
    } else if (scrollY > 300) {
      imgDesktop.src = "/public/imgs/Program/day-1/Designing-Brands-in-a-Noisy-World/img3.webp";
      imgMobile.src = "/public/imgs/Program/day-1/Designing-Brands-in-a-Noisy-World/img3.webp";
    } else if (scrollY > 200) {
      imgDesktop.src = "/public/imgs/Program/day-1/Designing-Brands-in-a-Noisy-World/img4.webp";
      imgMobile.src = "/public/imgs/Program/day-1/Designing-Brands-in-a-Noisy-World/img4.webp";
    } else {
      imgDesktop.src = "/public/imgs/Program/day-1/Designing-Brands-in-a-Noisy-World/img5.webp";
      imgMobile.src = "/public/imgs/Program/day-1/Designing-Brands-in-a-Noisy-World/img5.webp";
    }
  });
</script>
